flowchart TB
    agent[Agent or assignment ref\nagents/&lt;session&gt;/... + pinned SHA]
    review[Review ref\nteam/&lt;team&gt;/reviews/&lt;source-id&gt;]
    feature[Feature ref\nteam/&lt;team&gt;/features/&lt;task&gt;-&lt;agent&gt;]
    internal[Internal release ref\nteam/&lt;team&gt;/releases/&lt;release&gt;]
    candidate[Frozen candidate SHA, tree,\nevidence and reviewed-scope manifest]
    scope{Only reviewed\ncommits and paths?}
    verify{Verification commands}
    releaseReview{Required release reviews\nof the same candidate SHA}
    canonical[Canonical remote branch\nreleases/&lt;project&gt;/&lt;release&gt; by default]
    stop[Terminal candidate failure\nnew reviewed content and release required]
    retryVerify[Immutable successor verification run\nsame pinned candidate]
    retryReview[Immutable successor review\nsame pinned candidate]

    agent --> review --> feature --> internal --> candidate --> scope
    scope -- no --> stop
    scope -- yes --> verify
    verify -- command failure --> stop
    verify -- timeout or infrastructure failure --> retryVerify --> verify
    verify -- pass --> releaseReview
    releaseReview -- reject candidate --> stop
    releaseReview -- process blocked --> retryReview --> releaseReview
    releaseReview -- "all accept; expected SHA and destination lease" --> canonical

    recovery[team_recover_release repairs eligible failed\nfeature or internal-release Git promotion only.]
    recovery -. distinct from gate retry .-> feature
    recovery -. distinct from gate retry .-> internal

    publication[Agent, review, feature, and internal release refs stay in the managed bare repo.\nOnly the approved candidate is pushed to the canonical remote branch.]
    publication --- canonical
